guide forever/horde/07-ashenvale
title Ashenvale & Thousand Needles
faction Horde
levels 27-31
zone Ashenvale
next forever/horde/30-40/01-desolace

# Built from the simulator's consensus Horde route (export
# consensus-horde-tauren, visits 13-15) and Era-baseline reference data;
# not yet play-tested on Forever.
#
# Flow: fly from Ratchet to Zoram'gar Outpost -> the Zoram Strand (Vorsha,
# Sapphires of Aku'Mai) -> Thistlefur Village and Hold (Ruul's escort) ->
# Zoram'gar -> east: Ursangous, Alonso and Tideress at Mystral Lake -> the
# Foulweald (King of the Foulweald) -> Torek's assault and the Outrunners ->
# Splintertree Post (bind) -> Sharptalon -> Felmusk satyrs -> Shadumbra ->
# Mystral Lake (Stonetalon Standstill) -> hearth to Splintertree -> fly to
# Zoram'gar -> Thunder Bluff (flight path) -> Gloomrise, north of the bluffs
# -> fly to Camp Taurajo, down the Great Lift to Freewind Post
# (flight path, bind) -> Alien Egg -> Galak camps -> Dorn Plainstalker ->
# Freewind -> Grimtotem camps -> Darkcloud Pinnacle (Lakota) -> Whitereach
# Post and Highperch -> Roguefeather Den (Grenka, Jandia's harpies) ->
# Freewind -> Dorn -> the Shimmering Flats -> hearth to Freewind Post, where
# the next guide flies on to Orgrimmar.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Ashenvale: the export flies back and forth between Splintertree and
#   Zoram'gar (Karang's quests, the Foulweald) and visits Mystral Lake twice.
#   Here Karang's quests are handed in before heading east, the Foulweald,
#   Ursangous, Alonso and Tideress are done on the way east, and one hearth
#   and one flight to Zoram'gar at the end cover King of the Foulweald and
#   Je'neu of the Earthen Ring. The export binds at Splintertree and hearths
#   there twice; here one hearth does.
# - Dustwallow: the export ends this stay with Brackenwall Village and Witch
#   Hill at about 30, where the quests are level 35, the Theramore
#   Infiltrators 35-36 and the Theramore docks crowded with Young Murk
#   Threshers (40-41). Theramore Spies (1201), Soothing Spices (1218) and the
#   Loose Dirt pair (1238, 1239, with The Troll Witchdoctor 1240) move to
#   forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh at 39, which already stays in
#   Brackenwall. The Theramore Docks (1202) is dropped: the footlocker lies
#   among the threshers and below the Theramore guards.
# - The Lost Pages (6504) is optional: the export hands it in on the spot,
#   but its twelve manual pages drop at about 1% from Ashenvale mobs.
# - Thousand Needles: the export runs to the Shimmering Flats first and comes
#   back; here the western half is done first and the Flats quests are done
#   in one trip at the end. Free at Last (4904) is picked up from Lakota on
#   Darkcloud Pinnacle (the export takes it in the Barrens in the previous
#   guide). Message to Freewind Post (4542) is picked up from Brave Moonhorn
#   at the top of the Great Lift on the way down (the export takes it in the
#   previous guide, below his level-23 requirement).
# - Test of Endurance (1150) needs Grenka's Claw (Roguefeather Den); the
#   export hands it in without the trip. Test of Strength (1151) needs
#   Rok'Alim the Pounder, an elite: optional. Its follow-up, Test of Lore
#   (1152), is not taken: it ends with Braug Dimspirit in Stonetalon, which
#   the route does not visit again.
# - Mirage Raceway: Trackmaster Zherin and Pozzik, the first two you reach
#   coming off the flats, before the Brassbolts and Kravel.
#
# Optional: Test of Strength (1151): Rok'Alim the Pounder is elite: grouping
# up is advised.
#
# Carried on: Hemet Nesingwary (5762) and Martek the Exiled (1106, the
# Badlands in forever/horde/30-40/03-arathi-highlands) are turned in later
# on the route.
#
# Added from the new consensus route (Forever quests, from data; the beta
# caps at 30, so the level-30-31 parts are not checked in game):
# - Gloomrise in Mulgore: Talkin' bout Toxins, Mon (96241, Mazu'kon),
#   Stronger than Steel (96260, Yorn Grimtotem), Defending the Dead (96259,
#   Muln Earthfury) and A Darker Truth (96294, from Broodmother Valraxx's
#   Bloody Parchment). The Earthen Ring camp (Mulgore 32.5,20.6) and the
#   spiders (27-29, Mulgore 31-36,7-14) are just north of Thunder Bluff, so
#   the flight from Zoram'gar goes to Thunder Bluff instead of straight to
#   Camp Taurajo (the export does them at about 28.5 between Stonetalon and
#   Thousand Needles). Characters without the Thunder Bluff flight path ride
#   in from Camp Taurajo and take it.
# - Stop the Screeching (98070, Jandia at Freewind Post): the Screeching
#   harpies are the Roguefeather Den ones the route fights for Grenka's Claw.
# - Skyborne: Cairne Bloodhoof is visited on the Thunder Bluff stop for
#   Exploring the Horde (93739, from forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest);
#   Thrall takes it back in forever/horde/30-40/01-desolace.
#
# Restored: Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem (5147): the poster is at Freewind, Arnak
# (29, not elite) stands beside Lakota on Darkcloud Pinnacle, and the
# turn-in is the Freewind stop after it.
#
# Left out: Warsong Supplies (6571) and A New Ore Sample (1153): the export
# picks them up and never hands them in. Sacred Fire (5062): its turn-in at
# Magatha in Thunder Bluff is not on the route any more. The Blackfathom
# Deeps follow-ups from Je'neu (dungeon). The Sacred Flame (1197) needs 1195
# and 1196 (an Etched Phial from Stonetalon, filled at a moonwell, then
# Thunder Bluff), none of them on this route. Keeping Pace and Rizzle's
# Schematics (1190, 1194) need News for Fizzle (1137, from the Badlands
# chain 1108), not on this route.
#
# Class quests: Shamans fill Brine's blue waterskin (Call of Water 1534) at
# the fountain in the Ruins of Stardust while hunting Ursangous and hand it to
# Brine on the road south from Camp Taurajo; Vial of Purest Water (220) goes on
# to Islen Waterseer in forever/horde/30-40/01-desolace.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Zoram'gar Outpost

step Zoram'gar Outpost
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Fly from Ratchet to Zoram'gar Outpost on the Ashenvale coast.
  fly "Zoram'gar Outpost"
  turnin 6562                         -- Je'neu Sancrea
  accept 6563
  accept 216                          -- Karang Amakkar
  accept 6462                         -- Mitsuwa
  accept 6641                         -- Muglash: starts his escort at once

step Vorsha the Lasher
  tip Muglash walks north up the strand to a naga brazier. Put the brazier out, then guard him through the naga waves until Vorsha is dead.
  goto 9.6,27.6 "Naga brazier"
  complete 6641

# The Sapphires (objects 178184-178186, 12.9-13.8,10.6-13.5) grow in the
# tunnels under the strand that lead to the Blackfathom Deeps portal, outside
# the instance: "Within the beginning tunnels of Blackfathom Deeps, large
# sapphire clusters can be found along the cave walls" (the quest text), "the
# blue crystals that appear in the tunnels leading up to the instance, not
# inside the instance itself" and "go into the ruins and then down a bunch of
# stairs, swim under water to get to the other side of a wall"
# (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/quest=6563, comments). The way in is the
# ruins' pit at 14.5,14.2 (the client's Blackfathom Deeps entrance,
# dungeons.json; "The entrance is at 14,14, in the pit",
# https://www.wowhead.com/classic/zone=719, comments); a straight line from
# the brazier to the crystals ends on the strand above them.
step Blackfathom Deeps ruins
  tip The way to the Sapphires is through the sunken ruins at the north end of the strand: go down the stairs into the pit.
  goto 14.5,14.2 "Blackfathom Deeps ruins"

step Sapphires of Aku'Mai
  tip The Sapphires are blue crystals on the walls of the tunnels leading to the Blackfathom Deeps portal, underground and outside the instance: swim down from the pit, under the wall, into the cave. The satyrs and naga in the tunnels are elite: grouping up is advised. The crystals respawn quickly, so there is no need to go deep.
  collect 16784 quest 6563

step Zoram'gar Outpost
  turnin 6563                         -- Je'neu Sancrea
  turnin 6641                         -- Warsong Runner
  note Je'neu offers a Blackfathom Deeps quest next; leave it unless you have a group.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thistlefur

step Thistlefur Village
  tip East of Zoram'gar, the Thistlefur furbolgs fill the village and the hills around their hold.
  kill 3925 quest 216.1
  kill 3924 quest 216.2

step Thistlefur Hold
  tip Inside the hold, Troll Chests lie along the tunnels. Ruul Snowhoof is held deep inside: free him and protect him all the way out, then he runs home to Night Run.
  collect 16602 quest 6462
  accept 6482                         -- Ruul Snowhoof
  complete 6482

step Zoram'gar Outpost
  tip Back west to Zoram'gar before heading east for good.
  turnin 216                          -- Karang Amakkar
  accept 6621
  turnin 6462                         -- Mitsuwa

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East along the road

step Ursangous
  tip Follow the main road east past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road). Ursangous, a big grizzly, roams the Ruins of Stardust south of the road, west of Mystral Lake. His paw starts the next hunt quest.
  collect 16303
  accept 23 item 16303

step Ruins of Stardust fountain
  only Shaman
  tip The fountain stands in the middle of the Ruins of Stardust: use the Empty Blue Waterskin there.
  collect 7770 quest 1534.1

step Alonso
  tip Alonso, a Forever addition, stands on the west shore of Mystral Lake with three quick Dragonslayer quests.
  accept 78132
  turnin 78132
  accept 78133
  turnin 78133
  accept 78134
  turnin 78134

step Tideress
  tip Tideress, a corrupted water elemental, drifts in Mystral Lake. Her Befouled Water Globe starts a quest for Splintertree.
  collect 16408
  accept 1918 item 16408

step King of the Foulweald
  tip The Foulweald furbolgs hold the woods east of Mystral Lake, south of the road. Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound and guard it: the furbolgs come to tear it down. Chief Murgut comes last; his totem drops in the basket.
  collect 16976 quest 6621

step Torek's Assault
  tip Keep east on the road. Torek waits south-west of the Warsong lumber camp. He and his grunts storm the Silverwing Outpost: let them take aggro and stay with Torek until Duriel Moonfire is dead.
  accept 6544
  complete 6544

step Ashenvale Outrunners
  tip Kuray'bin stands at the lumber camp. The night elf Outrunners stalk the woods south-east of it; they stealth, so watch for them.
  accept 6503
  kill 12856 quest 6503
  turnin 6503

step Splintertree Post
  tip North up the road to Splintertree Post and Night Run beside it.
  sethome "Splintertree Post"
  turnin 6544                         -- Ertog Ragetusk
  turnin 6482                         -- Yama Snowhoof
  turnin 23                           -- Senani Thunderheart
  turnin 1918                         -- Mastok Wrilehiss
  accept 824
  accept 25
  accept 6441                         -- Pixel
  accept 6504 optional                -- Gurda Ragescar: only if you carry the manual pages
  turnin 6504 optional
  vendor nearest

step Sharptalon
  tip Sharptalon, a big nightsaber, prowls the woods south-east of the Warsong lumber camp. Her claw starts the next hunt quest.
  collect 16305
  accept 2 item 16305

step Felmusk satyrs
  tip North-west of Splintertree, the Felmusk satyrs camp in the woods. Every satyr can drop horns.
  collect 5481 quest 6441

step Shadumbra
  tip Shadumbra, a shadow panther, stalks the woods around Raynewood Retreat, west of the Felmusk camp. Her head starts the next hunt quest.
  collect 16304
  accept 24 item 16304

step Mystral Lake
  tip Back south-west to Mystral Lake. Befouled Water Elementals drift around its shores; the gazebo stands on the island, overlooking the Alliance outpost.
  kill 3917 quest 25.1
  goto 48.9,69.6 "Gazebo"
  complete 25

step Splintertree Post
  hearth "Splintertree Post"
  turnin 25                           -- Mastok Wrilehiss
  turnin 6441                         -- Pixel
  turnin 2                            -- Senani Thunderheart
  turnin 24
  accept 247
  turnin 247

step Zoram'gar Outpost
  fly "Zoram'gar Outpost"
  turnin 6621                         -- Karang Amakkar
  turnin 824                          -- Je'neu Sancrea

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gloomrise, Mulgore

step Thunder Bluff
  zone Mulgore
  tip Fly to Thunder Bluff if you know the flight path. If not, fly to Camp Taurajo, ride west into Mulgore past Bloodhoof Village to Thunder Bluff and take its flight path from Tal on the central rise.
  getfp "Thunder Bluff" npc 2995      -- Tal
  kill 3057 quest 93739.3 only Skyborne optional -- Speak with Cairne Bloodhoof, in Thunder Bluff: Exploring the Horde

step The Earthen Ring
  tip Take a lift down from Thunder Bluff. The Earthen Ring camp stands north of the bluffs: Mazu'kon, Yorn Grimtotem and Muln Earthfury.
  accept 96241 @32.5,20.6 live        -- Mazu'kon
  accept 96260                        -- Yorn Grimtotem
  accept 96259                        -- Muln Earthfury

step Gloomrise
  tip North of the camp, spiders overrun the burial ground at Gloomrise. Use Mazu'kon's Toxin Extractor on the Gnawed Corpses; the Spinners drop the Crystalline Silk. Broodmother Valraxx sits at the north end: her Bloody Parchment starts A Darker Truth.
  collect 273001 quest 96241.1        -- Gloomrise Toxin Samples, from the Gnawed Corpses
  collect 273181 quest 96260.1        -- Crystalline Silk, from Gloomrise Spinners
  kill 264083 quest 96259.1
  kill 264079 quest 96259.2
  collect 273658 @33.4,7.6            -- Bloody Parchment, from Broodmother Valraxx
  accept 96294 item 273658

step The Earthen Ring
  tip Back south to the camp, then up into Thunder Bluff for the flight to Camp Taurajo.
  turnin 96241                        -- Mazu'kon
  turnin 96260                        -- Yorn Grimtotem
  turnin 96259                        -- Muln Earthfury
  turnin 96294

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Freewind Post

step Brine
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly from Thunder Bluff to Camp Taurajo. Brine's hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole south of the camp, on the road to the Great Lift.
  fly "Camp Taurajo"
  turnin 1534                         -- Brine
  accept 220                          -- for Islen Waterseer, south of Ratchet: next guide

step The Great Lift
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly from Thunder Bluff to Camp Taurajo and take the road south to the Great Lift at the bottom of the Barrens.
  fly "Camp Taurajo"
  goto 44.2,92.2 "The Great Lift"
  accept 4542 npc 10079               -- Brave Moonhorn, at the top of the lift

step Freewind Post
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Ride the lift down, then follow the road east through the canyons to Freewind Post, a Tauren village on top of the mesas. Its lift is on the north side.
  getfp "Freewind Post"
  sethome "Freewind Post"
  turnin 4542                         -- Cliffwatcher Longhorn
  accept 4841
  accept 4821                         -- Hagar Lightninghoof
  accept 4767                         -- Elu, by the wind rider master
  accept 98070                        -- Jandia, the trade supplies vendor: the Screeching harpies of Roguefeather Den
  accept 5147                         -- The Wanted poster beside Cliffwatcher

step Alien Egg
  tip Take the lift down. The egg lies in a nest on the canyon floor in one of three spots: south-east of the mesas (52.3,55.2), east (56.4,50.4) or south-west (37.6,56.1).
  collect 12467 quest 4821

step Freewind Post
  turnin 4821                         -- Hagar Lightninghoof
  accept 4865

step Galak centaurs
  tip The Galak camps fill the canyon north of Freewind; Scouts, Wranglers and Windchasers share every camp. A lone Galak Messenger walks between the camps: kill him when you meet him, his note starts a quest for Whitereach Post.
  kill 4094 quest 4841.1
  kill 4093 quest 4841.2
  kill 4096 quest 4841.3
  collect 12564
  accept 4881 item 12564

step Dorn Plainstalker
  tip Dorn Plainstalker stands on a mesa top east of the Galak camps. For the Test of Faith, walk off the end of the planks beside him: you land safely.
  accept 1149                         -- Dorn Plainstalker
  complete 1149
  turnin 1149
  accept 1150

step Freewind Post
  turnin 4841                         -- Cliffwatcher Longhorn
  accept 5064

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkcloud Pinnacle and Whitereach Post

step Grimtotem camps
  tip West of Freewind, the Grimtotem camps below Darkcloud Pinnacle. The Secret Notes are in Document Chests at the south-east, south-west and north-west camps.
  interact 190484 quest 5064.3        -- Document Chest, south-east camp
  interact 190483 quest 5064.2        -- Document Chest, south-west camp
  interact 176344 quest 5064.1        -- Document Chest, north-west camp

step Lakota Windsong
  tip Climb the path to the top of Darkcloud Pinnacle. Lakota Windsong is held captive beside Arnak Grimtotem (29): clear the guards and Arnak first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way.
  collect 12884 quest 5147 @38.1,26.9 -- Arnak Grimtotem
  accept 4904 @37.95,26.45            -- Lakota Windsong
  complete 4904

step Whitereach Post
  tip Follow the canyon west to Whitereach Post.
  turnin 4865                         -- Motega Firemane
  note Motega's next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in Thunder Bluff, off this route. Skip it.
  turnin 4881                         -- Kanati Greycloud
  accept 4966
  complete 4966                       -- Kill the Galak Assassin that comes for Kanati
  turnin 4966

step Highperch
  tip West of Whitereach the wyverns nest on the Highperch cliffs; the eggs lie in the nests. Pao'ka Swiftmountain waits on the east side of the nesting grounds: free him and keep him alive on the walk back to Whitereach Post.
  collect 12356 quest 4767
  accept 4770                         -- Pao'ka Swiftmountain
  complete 4770

step Whitereach Post
  turnin 4770                         -- Motega Firemane

step Roguefeather Den
  tip South of Darkcloud, the harpies of Roguefeather Den. Grenka Bloodscreech (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her. The Screeching Harpies, Roguefeathers and Windcallers there are Jandia's.
  collect 5843 quest 1150
  kill 4100 quest 98070.1
  kill 4101 quest 98070.2
  kill 4104 quest 98070.3

step Freewind Post
  turnin 5064                         -- Cliffwatcher Longhorn
  turnin 5147
  turnin 4904                         -- Thalia Amberhide
  turnin 4767                         -- Elu
  turnin 98070                        -- Jandia
  vendor nearest

step Test of Endurance
  turnin 1150                         -- Dorn Plainstalker
  accept 1151 optional

step Rok'Alim the Pounder
  tip Rok'Alim, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of Highperch. Rok'Alim the Pounder is elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 5844 quest 1151 optional
  turnin 1151 optional                -- Dorn Plainstalker

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shimmering Flats

step Mirage Raceway
  tip Follow the canyon east out of the mesas onto the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions.
  accept 1110                         -- Kravel Koalbeard
  accept 5762                         -- His crate is for Stranglethorn, later on the route
  accept 1104                         -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1105                         -- Wizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1175                         -- Trackmaster Zherin
  accept 1176                         -- Pozzik

step The salt flats
  tip Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats north of the raceway. Scorpid Reavers and Sparkleshell Tortoises roam the north half, Salt Flats Scavengers circle overhead, and Saltstone Basilisks graze west of the track. The Crystalhides roam the middle of the flats and the Gazers (34-35, five levels above you: one at a time) the far south.
  collect 5798 quest 1110
  collect 5794 quest 1104
  collect 5795 quest 1105
  collect 5848 quest 1176
  kill 4147 quest 1175.1
  kill 4151 quest 1175.2
  kill 4150 quest 1175.3

step Mirage Raceway
  turnin 1175                         -- Trackmaster Zherin
  turnin 1176                         -- Pozzik
  turnin 1110                         -- Kravel Koalbeard
  turnin 1104                         -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  turnin 1105                         -- Wizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1106                         -- Fizzle Brassbolts: his letter goes to Martek in the Badlands, around level 38

step Freewind Post
  hearth "Freewind Post"
  note The next guide flies on from here to Orgrimmar.
